LOCUS       R6Kgamma_ori             389 bp    DNA              UNK 01-JAN-1980
DEFINITION  The R6K gamma origin of replication: the 389 bp segment from base 1
            of the sequenced autonomously replicating R6K segment, carrying the
            seven 22-bp pi iterons; replicates only where the R6K pi protein
            (pir) is supplied in trans..
